#adm/daemons/mailmesg.c
remain ({"almuhara",})
mesg "天罪原路线:1. kill good boy get key.2. use key enter sword_tomb3. ask sword saint about here,sword_tomb, and seal4. ask good boy abou seal(他已经挂了,不是吗??)5. ask archmaster about seal,get pill6. kill 3 sword...insert 3 sword7. kill sky guilt8. take dead sky guilt go archmaster,got exp --<END> 现路线:1. kill boys enter wife room2. look box,ask wife about box,get key3. 同前3.之後 欲改为以下路线:1. get old scroll enter wife's room (how???)---->3   or get break jade enter wife's room (how???)---->4   or kill boy enter wife room ----->22. ask wife about box,got key.---->53. ask wife about scroll ----->64. ask wife about jade ---->75. ask sword saint about here,sword_tomb, and seal ---->86. ask wife about box,got key ---->107. ask wife about box,got key ---->98. 同上原路线3以後之解法......by this way, sky guilt is HARDEST to kill.9. ask saint about here,sword_tomb, and seal --->1110. ask saint about here,sword_tomb,and seal --->1211. ask good boy and archmaster about seal, ask archmaster about jade --->1312. ask good boy and archmaster about seal, ask archmaster about scroll --->1413. use jade order 3 sword give sword ----> 1514. kill 3 sword.---->1615. kill sky_guilt ---->1716. use scroll reduce sky_guilt's power, and kill sky guilt ---->1817. take dead sky_guilt go archmaster,get exp <END>    by this way, 少打三只剑......easier than the first way.18. take dead sky_guilt go archmaster,get exp <END>    by this way, 天罪变弱.....easier than the first way. ps. old scroll and break jade can use at the same time, by this way,    this quest is easiest to solve.     but......how to put scroll and jade in this area???????? "
